Package: bocel
Title: Access the Brazilian Elective Office Occupancy Database (BOCEL)
Version: 0.1.0
Authors@R:
    person("Igor Novaes", "Lins", , "igor.lins@cebrap.org.br",
           role = c("aut", "cre", "cph"),
           comment = c(ORCID = "0000-0003-0510-8355"))
Description: Downloads from 'Zenodo' and reads the tables of the Brazilian
    Elective Office Occupancy Database (BOCEL), 1998-2024, which records
    terms of office, office occupancy including substitutes, and party
    affiliation of presidents, state governors, senators and federal deputies
    in Brazil <doi:10.5281/zenodo.22896271>. Each table is returned with the
    column types of the codebook and cached by database version. Function
    names and documentation are in Portuguese.
License: MIT + file LICENSE
URL: https://github.com/igornovaeslins/bocel-r,
    https://doi.org/10.5281/zenodo.22896271
BugReports: https://github.com/igornovaeslins/bocel-r/issues
Depends:
    R (>= 4.1)
Imports:
    readr,
    tibble,
    tools,
    utils
